    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\displaystyle\\binom{n}{2}=\\frac{n!}{2!(n-2)!}=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\binom{n}{2}&=\\frac{n!}{2!(n-2)!}\\\\\\binom{n}{2}&=\\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)!}{2(n-2)!}\\\\\\binom{n}{2}&=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
